>>   spin_unlock_bh(&tc_lock);
>> ... spin_lock_bh(&tc_lock)
>> ...   timecounter_init()
>> ...   first = true;
>> ... spin_unlock_bh(&tc_lock)
>> ... schedule_delayed_work()
>>   cancel_delayed_work_sync()
>>
>> And the device will have no worker while active_timestamp_channels is not 0.
>>
